;====================<WINQUOTES>====================
[Quotes]
victory0 = "That look in your eyes... Never forget the fighting spirit you feel now."
victory1 = "I'm ready for a rematch should we cross paths again."
victory2 = "I've a better understanding now of what it means to be a true warrior..."
victory3 = "A clenched fist speaks louder than a hundred words."
victory4 = "What a fight! You have my gratitude."
victory5 = "You must defeat my Shoryuken to stand a chance!"
victory6 = "I walk my own path, regardless of what direction other men take."
victory7 = "This is the power of Hado! The spirit channeled through the fist!"
victory8 = "Don't forget the training you've had until now! Get up and fight again!"
victory9 = "Shoes? No, I can't certainly afford them. I go barefoot for comfort."

;Ryu
victory10 = "The greatest struggle is against oneself..."

;Evil Ryu
victory11 = "What a nightmare... Please, wake up!"

;Ken Masters
victory12 = "One more time. Let's see how far we can both go!"

;Gouki
victory13 = "Even if I won, I'm not sure I have what I'm looking for..."

;Shin Gouki
victory14 = "... I have no regrets. I hope... That you find your peace."

;Gouken
victory15 = "Thank you, Master!"

;Athena Asamiya
victory16 = "Good luck to you too. I'll continue my own way!"

;Balrog (Claw)
victory17 = "A sharp needle easily breaks. You weren't focused enough on the fight!"

;Batsu Ichimonji
victory18 = "Getting ahead doesn't come by charging in headfirst. Focus your thoughts, then attack!"

;Benimaru Nikaido
victory19 = "What you call your 'masculine appeal' isn't limited to your looks alone, I see."

;M. Bison (Boxer)
victory20 = "Your fist is clouded. Their true 'weight' is being held back!"

;Blanka
victory21 = "The power of the wild. I can't afford to treat it lightly."	

;Cammy White
victory22 = "Against a soulless fist, I can claim no victory!"

;Chang Koehan
victory23 = "There's nothing in this world that's worth losing your freedom over..."

;Casshern
victory24 = "Half a step can be the difference between victory and defeat. Today, victory is mine."

;Chun-Li
victory25 = "No matter how often we fight, I'm always amazed at the depth of the Chinese Martial Arts."

;Dan Hibiki
victory26 = "You know what you need to do. You can start by simply standing up."	

;Deadpool
victory27 = "Huh? You stole my Shoryuken!? When did you...?!"

;Dhalsim
victory28 = "Thank you for your advice. But... I already know the path I must take."

;E. Honda
victory29 = "The power of Sumo; I'm truly impressed!"

;Eaqle
victory30 = "In a fight, you need to give your all. Getting distracted means you've already lost!"

;Frank West
victory31 = "You've taught me a valuable lesson. I've met hundreds of the world's best fighters, but this is the first time I've met one that's a cameraman!"

;Geese Howard
victory32 = "Using advanced techniques, without understanding them fully, will just threaten your life!"

;Guile
victory33 = "The techniques I use were developed in a time of war. But I would never use them with the intent to kill!"	

;Haohmaru
victory34 = "You swung without hesitation. Did my fists meet your expectations?"

;Heihachi Mishima
victory35 = "Your strength betrays your age! Is it because your spirit is so fierce?"	

;Hibiki Takane
victory36 = "I've had my own share of worries. What I learned was that the best thing to do is to simply walk forward."

;Iori Yagami
victory37 = "Your rage is something to respect... But you'll never gain true victory if that's all you rely on!"

;Jin Kazama
victory38 = "I would never give up, no matter how tough things were. What will you do?"

;Joe Higashi
victory39 = "As I thought, from a Muay Thai fighter. I could have lost from just a single blow."

;Kazuya Mishima
victory40 = "The Devil Gene and Satsui no Hado... Am I wrong in feeling that these powers are somehow similar?"

;Kim Kaphwan
victory41 = "Fighting for what's right is admirable. But... be careful it doesn't become an obsession!"

;King
victory42 = "Don't give up until the very end! You never know what you're capable of in a pinch!"

;Kyo Kusanagi
victory43 = "'Man of fire', huh. You remind me a lot of a good friend."

;Kyosuke Kagami
victory44 = "You're pretty good at studying movements. But there's a big difference between studying and training!"

;Mai Shiranui
victory45 = "You're as fast as a hornet. I could barely even keep track of you."

;Maki Genryusai
victory46 = "I'm sure you'll find the man that you're looking for. Just keep fighting with your heart!"

;Morrigan Aensland
victory47 = "Even if my body turns to dust, my spirit will never bow to your whims!"

;Nakoruru
victory48 = "It's not the same as the will to fight, but... I felt a strong 'spirit' from you all the same..."

;Raiden
victory49 = "I wasn't putting on a show. Withstanding your blows took more than I thought I had."

;Rock Howard
victory50 = "The bigger the wall, the more rewarding it is to break through. I've no doubt that you'll do so!"

;Rolento F. Schugerg
victory51 = "Creating a nation, huh... That's a dream too big for me to understand."

;Rugal Bernstein
victory52 = "Learning all martial arts is very different from mastering a single fist!"

;Ryo Sakazaki
victory53 = "We both seek to find our own limits. I think you walk a road as long as my own..."

;Sakura Kasugano
victory54 = "All right, let's go again. If I rest easy, I feel like you'll overtake me before I know it."

;Sagat
victory55 = "That strength is the real deal... It's truly an inspiration!"

;Terry Bogard
victory56 = "Your fist spoke as clear as day... It's rare to see a conviction as strong as yours!"	

;Ryuhaku Todoh
victory57 = "To bring just a single technique to such a high level... I still have much to learn."	

;Vega (Dictator)
victory58 = "The strength I'm searching for has nothing to do with your corrupt power!"

;Vice
victory59 = "I never attained my strength by taking it easy. All I've learned is from hard work and constant training!"	

;Yang
victory60 = "Only by finding yourself can you truly live. Remember this."

;Ryuji Yamazaki
victory61 = "Disappointing. Still, you're strong enough, even if you're holding back."	

;Yun
victory62 = "When you're young, you'll improve with each fight. I look forward to seeing you again."

;Yuri Sakazaki
victory63 = "Learning the martial arts with such a cheerful attitude is great. You'll be much stronger with time."	

;Zangief
victory64 = "Just as I'd expect! You answered my fist with an indomitable spirit!"	

;Zero
victory65 = "If I had let up for just one second, I would have lost... My journey to be the greatest warrior is still not complete..."



;====================<EVIL RYU WINQUOTES>====================
victory66 = "It's hot! The murderous intent is crawling all over my body!"
victory67 = "Is... Is this the murderous impulse I wanted?"
victory68 = "These eyes can't help but destroy everything it sees!"
victory69 = "This is a battle to be the strongest warrior! Where only one is left standing!"
victory70 = "Your blood is flowing... I'll stop it!"

;Ryu
victory71 = "This is it! If I defeat myself, I am complete!"

;Evil Ryu
victory72 = "Satsui no Hado... Only one man can possess such power!"

;Ken
victory73 = "It's over, Ken. Now, not even you can stop me!"

;Gouki
victory74 = "The time has come.... We will see who is stronger once and for all!"

;Gouken
victory75 = "Stop me? Death will welcome you with a cold embrace!"



;====================<SHADOW RYU WINQUOTES>====================
victory76 = "I am the answer! I am power!"
victory77 = "Your journey ends here!"
victory78 = "The power to defeat, crush, and kill is the only power there is!"
victory79 = "All shall perish and be forgotten!"
victory80 = "Death is all!"

;Ryu
victory81 = "Say it! Your strength comes from me!"

;Ken
victory82 = "Is that it?"

;Gouki
victory83 = "I am the power you seek!"



;====================<EX RYU WINQUOTES>====================
victory84 = "I will keep on fighting. I know the answer lies ahead."
victory85 = "The path to becoming a true martial artist never ends."
victory86 = "What I seek is to use my power beyond fighting."
victory87 = "I will never forget this fight."
victory88 = "Prove yourself."

;Ryu
victory89 = "No matter how far I come, the one I must face... is myself."

;Ken
victory90 = "You know talking has never been my strong suit. I prefer to let my fists speak for me."

;Gouki
victory91 = "The path of a true fighter never ends. We can only move forward one step at a time."



;====================<SHIN RYU WINQUOTES>====================
victory92 = "This was a battle of spirits, not fists. Search your soul if you want to beat me!"
victory93 = "I really broke a sweat! How about another round?"
victory94 = "Blind pride can only hold you back. There are fighters out there stronger than either of us!"
victory95 = "If you want to be a true fighter... Go and train!"
victory96 = "I know you can do better! Get up and try again!"

;Ryu
victory97 = "This power is not to defeat... This is the power to push forward!"

;Ken
victory98 = 

