;====================<EXTRA WINQUOTES>====================
;Abel
;victory100 = "The answers you seek will come to you during your journey, my friend."

;Abigail
;victory101 = "If judging by the force behind your fists, you're the strongest opponent I've yet faced... but, you lack any sort of discipline."

;Adon
;victory102 = "You have a long way to go if you ever hope to defeat Sagat!"	

;Akira Kazama
;victory103 = "So your bond with your brother gives you strength? There is much to learn on a warrior's path..."

;Alex
;victory104 = "Your fists show a lot of potential. I wait for the day we meet again."

;Avenger
;victory105 = "Sometimes standing together, sometimes opposed, always forcing each other up to great heights. You Avengers are a good team."

;Birdie
;victory106 = "If you were a wrestler, you may be able to win in a decent way."

;Chris Redfield
;victory107 = "Your attacks were proof of your military discipline. But too much discipline leads to predictability."

;Cody Travers
;victory108 = "You cannot run from who you are. The fight won't provide the solace you seek."

;C. Viper
;victory109 = "Your devices make for interesting moves, but they are easily avoided."

;Decapre
;victory110 = "Strange...you don't hesitate. Yet, I can see you trembling."

;Dee Jay
;victory111 = "There's no depth in how you fight, but no darkness either. That's for the best, I think."

;Dudley
;victory112 = "I am grateful, for you have shown me the grace inherent in the art of boxing."

;Ed
;victory113 = "Stay true to yourself, and move forward! I'll accept your challenge anytime."

;Elena
;victory114 = "Listen to the sound of the wind, eh? I think I know what you mean by that."

;Falke
;victory115 = "I could sense your strong conviction in every one of your attacks."

;F.A.N.G.
;victory116 = "You rely too much on poison. There's no power in your punches."

;Fei Long
;victory117 = "There is an artistic quality to your moves. You are a true master!"

;El Fuerte
;victory118 = "I have no likes or dislikes when it comes to food. I'll eat anything."	

;G
;victory119 = "I'm not sure how I should feel about this victory..."

;Gen
;victory120 = "You may be strong, but you lack the drive for self-improvement."

;Gill
;victory121 = "I'm not sure how I should feel about this victory..."

;Guy
;victory122 = "Bushin-ryu is an incredible art. Your speed is without rival!"

;Hakan
;victory123 = "I look forward to seeing what other moves you have in store next time!"

;Hugo
;victory124 = "You need strength to win, but there is no point to strength alone."

;Ibuki
;victory125 = "You're speedy, but you have to keep an eye on your opponent if you want to win!"

;Orochi Iori
;victory126 = "Are you relying on madness? Then I don't consider you as an opponent!"

;Iron Fist
;victory127 = "It was my pleasure to meet a warrior who fights with honor. I hope that our paths will cross again."

;Jamie Siu
;victory128 = "Drunken Boxing might be a tricky fighting style, but I can tell you're honest at heart."

;Jean Grey
;victory129 = "I see you are battling your inner demons. You must prove that you are stronger than they are."

;JP
;victory130 = "Your strength defies explanation... But I am who I am. I will not waver."

;Juli
;victory131 = "Precise aim, lean movement... It's like a machine."

;Juni
;victory132 = "You can't be strong until you feel frustration."	

;Juri Han
;victory133 = "You can't bring too much baggage into a fight. Not unless you want to drive yourself to madness."

;Kage
;victory134 = "If you want to exist, then exist. If you want to leave, then leave."

;Karin Kanzuki
;victory135 = "You strike without hesitation. That is your strength."

;Kimberly Jackson
;victory136 = "Your take on Bushinryu is unique. Cherish those differences."

;Kolin
;victory137 = "You have to find your true self before you can hope to beat me!"

;Laura Matsuda
;victory138 = "Matsuda Jiu-Jitsu...? I seem to remember my master mentioning it."

;Lily Hawk
;victory139 = "I've sensed this wind before. Is this... A spirit?"

;Lucia Morgan
;victory140 = "No need to take me in for questioning. I'm just a martial artist looking for answers."

;Luke Sullivan
;victory141 = "Your fists show you the path forward. I see my younger self in you."

;Makoto
;victory142 = "You're still wet behind the ears, but I sense great potential within you."

;Manon Legrand
;victory143 = "Graceful, yet truly powerful. Your throws are superb."

;Marisa Rossetti
;victory144 = "I could tell you were giving it your all. An excellent fight-and a refreshing one."

;Menat
;victory145 = "Fate, huh. Whatever it may be, all I can do is keep moving forward."

;Charlie Nash
;victory146 = "The path of vengeance may not lead to the answers you seek."

;Necalli
;victory147 = "I felt absolutely nothing from your fists. This has never happened before..."

;Necro
;victory148 = "You'll never be landing a hit, even if it came from my blind spots."

;Nemesis
;victory149 = "Face your anger enough times, and eventually you'll overcome it. So come on, let's go for another round!"

;Nina Williams
;victory150 = "I fight for self-enlightenment. There's no need to take a life for that."

;Oni
;victory151 = "We have different philosophies on how to acquire power. This much I know."

;Oro
;victory152 = "Senjutsu? Sounds interesting, but I prefer to walk my own path."

;Paul Phoenix
;victory153 = "Your goal is to be the best in the universe? I’m looking forward to seeing your progress next time!"

;Poison
;victory154 = "Though you and I seek a different strength, you are strong in your own right."

;Phoenix Wright
;victory155 = "Your sense of justice is strong, but a warrior's fist is always stronger than his mouth."

;Q
;victory156 = "... What a suspicious guy. Don't think you're much of a 'guy' to begin with, though."

;R. Mika
;victory157 = "Fighting wrestlers is about range. You win or lose on one step alone."

;Rashid
;victory158 = "We need a rematch where you're more serious. I know you're capable of much more."

;Remy
;victory159 = "Your fists won't grow stronger while harboring hatred against others."

;Roll
;victory160 = "No need to lose heart. You too are a great fighter."

;Rose
;victory161 = "My future may be decided, but I will not stray from my path."

;Rufus
;victory162 = "So you're looking for Ken, are you? I'll be sure to let him know."

;God Rugal
;victory163 = "Even when things seem hopeless, I have faith. The path to true mastery means pushing ahead, no matter what!"

;Saki Omokane
;victory164 = "I hope this fight has reminded you what you are fighting for. Thank me by returning to your own path!"

;Sean
;victory165 = "Don't give up so easily after 10, or even 20 failures!"

;Seth
;victory166 = "Fighting makes us stronger, but what does it make you?"

;Sodom
;victory167 = "Throw away your weapons and armor. I want to fight with my bare hands"

;Hideyasu "Soki" Yuki
;victory168 = "Your blade is as sharp as my fist is strong. We are true equals in power!"

;T. Hawk
;victory169 = "There exists no obstacle that cannot be overcome. Experience has taught me this."

;Twelve
;victory170 = "You have me at a loss... I can't get a fix on your emotions at all."

;Urien
;victory171 = "There's no doubt you're strong, but your fists lack an essential ingredient."

;Viewtiful Joe
;victory172 = "You won't defeat me with those weak punches, even if you hit me ten thousand times!"

;Rock Volnutt
;victory173 = "If you give up now, then you're finished. Could you be satisfied with yourself then?"

;Wolverine
;victory174 = "And I thought facing someone with one claw was bad enough. You really put me to the test. Thank you."

;Zeku
;victory175 = "There's definitely a sense of depth to techniques from a long-standing discipline."